      "mergedPostDetails": "I typically put claw renderers on my avatars. Which are the blue and red avatars in particular. The pink one is a retexture for my boyfriend. The siamese cat is a retexture for a commission. The mayus I haven't even updated in a while but to the best of my knowledge the trails were working just fine up until a recent update within the last month. Heck even the trail that comes with the khnfucat avatar base is having the same issues and I haven't done anything with it. And my graphics/particle settings don't seem to affect it at all. I'm sure it's been posted before, but with inadequate responses to pin down the error. Again local, everyone else sees the particles working normally. And so do I except when I see a mirror or when there's a camera. Which also means I can't record mmd videos with the claw trails on until I have a fix/workaround, or it gets fixed if it's vrchat side. \n\nThese are my private avatar keys:\n\navtr_c393ee17-baea-4b0a-8d4c-84dfda841b55\n\navtr_7f5d7b84-3efb-433c-8d47-40b20988bce8\n\navtr_0b7a44ec-1fca-41fd-83a0-3a4299274b69\n\navtr_b72fe6b2-a9a3-41ad-802f-649cd836cf24\n\navtr_7fda757d-8904-4056-bb36-af8f352d0cd3\n\navtr_bfcbb584-9bea-47f6-83ca-4876ae1f059f",
