      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can confirm this has been an ongoing issue for me that has persisted since 2024.4.1p1, build 1534. \n\nIn testing, we found that only some people experience the issue, and it is always when viewing their own avatar in a mirror or camera, even if others are wearing the same avatar; i.e. the same avatar will behave differently on different systems, but it is only the user's own image of themselves that shows the issue.\n\nThis is a Steam overlay screenshot from early November. The issue persists today. This example uses a free Trail Renderer 'pen' asset.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
