      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Thanks to everyone that's been providing additional info and evidence. While we've still been unable to reproduce this problem internally, we've recently made a change to how avatar mirroring is processed that we hope might solve this issue. This fix is expected to be included in the open beta for version 2025.1.2.\n\nWe'd be grateful if anyone that's been consistently suffering from this problem could please check it again in the next open beta once it becomes available to help us verify if this issue has been fixed. Thank you!",
